  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BIOFIN II Uganda. Main objective is to support Uganda&#x2019;s NBFP &#x201c;sustainable and innovative financing for biodiversity conservation and management attained by 2027/28&#x201d;. The mission of the NBFP is &#x201c;to mobilise adequate additional financial resources to meet the biodiversity funding gap as well as ensure that funds are used efficiently and effectively to address the biodiversity and ecosystem challenges in biodiversity and ecosystem conservation and management.&#x201d;</narrative>
  </description>
